WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:07.980
<b>Expanded History of Japan</b>

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:07.580
So that's when the 
Honnouji Incident occurs.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:10.590
And that was masterminded 
by Mitsuhide Akechi.

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:15.490
It's commonsense Japanese history, 
so I expect you all to know about it.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.720
That said...

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:22.240
You, professional textbook juggler!

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.160
Look at me!

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:25.830
Answer me now!

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:25.830
<b>Honnouji 
Incident</b>

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:25.830
<b>Azuchi
 Castle 
built</b>

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:25.830
<b>Muromachi
 bakufu 
collapses</b>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.710
Who started the Honnouji Incident?!

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.860
Umm...

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:35.310
I think it was...

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:37.780
Aida-san!

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:50.780
Who cares what happened 
in Japan's past?

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:53.740
It has...

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.450
...nothing to do...

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:58.580
...with my life.

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:24.480
Horse!

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:27.720
Ah, there...

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:31.860
You seem suspicious.

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:33.420
Who are you?

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:34.650
Saburou...

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:38.260
You... you look like...

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.910
Oh, yeah!

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:42.160
You look like me!

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:44.900
No wonder you looked so familiar.

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:47.160
What's up with the costume?

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.570
Are you filming for a period film?

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:50.750
Where are the cameras?

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:59.500
What's this unfamiliar scenery?

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.550
My lord!

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:04.190
The castle's already 
figured me out.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.890
My lord!

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:08.450
Where am I?

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:10.880
Who am I?

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:10.880
You!

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:14.380
I ask you to use your manly face

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:16.030
to be my decoy!

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:18.640
Hm?

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:22.670
You must know me if 
you're from around here.

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:24.740
Heir to the Oda family, Nobunaga.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:28.540
Oh, sure, who wouldn't 
know of Nobunaga?

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:33.690
I have always been frail.

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:36.290
I won't last through 
these troubled times.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:39.960
I apologize to my family,

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:43.420
but for now, I want to 
rest somewhere peaceful.

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:48.230
I will repay you.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:52.690
With this short sword.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.830
Whoa, katana!

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.870
I'm counting on you.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.560
Awesome...

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:04.490
My lord!

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:12.120
My lord! What happened?

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.460
My lord!

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:16.320
I'm so glad you're okay.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:20.090
Where exactly...

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.740
...am I?!

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.850
<i>We are at the end of 
the Sengoku period.</i>

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:29.180
<i>Indeed, he has slipped 
through time.</i>

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.990
<b>Episode 1</b>

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.990
<b>Saburou Nobunaga</b>

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:42.990
Master,

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:45.990
just what is the matter

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:48.990
for you to run off as you did?

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:54.210
It is unlike you, such a well-mannered 
and distinguished young man.

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:59.670
And what of that bizarre clothing?

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:05.670
You must dress properly 
to display your majesty.

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:08.370
Never again...

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:11.720
Wait!

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:14.620
It's hard to move.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:20.920
Master!

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:23.330
<i>Masahide Hirate.</i>

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:26.600
<i>Chief family servant and 
educator to Nobunaga.</i>

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.780
<i>Tsuneoki Ikeda.</i>

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:36.100
<i>Foster brother, 
and closest aide to Nobunaga.</i>

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:43.030
Damn, they're annoying.

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.200
What did I do to get lectured?

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:54.990
The hell are you doing?

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:08.120
Yeah!

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:12.830
Tsuneoki, was it?

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.120
Come join us!

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:15.910
Come on!

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:22.270
Have you gone mad, Brother?

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:25.320
<i>Nobunaga's younger blood 
brother, Nobuyuki.</i>

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:29.920
Rumors have spread 
outside the castle.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:32.370
They're saying, 
"His body has become well,

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:35.020
and his head has become ill."

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:41.000
It seems things are 
lining up for me now.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:51.830
Master!

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.340
Dammit, busted.

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:58.190
Truly, what has become of you?

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:03.900
You were sickly before,
yet sober and bright.

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:04.660
My lord!

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:06.670
Enough with your selfish!

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:11.880
Indeed, my boy, you are 
unreasonable as of late.

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:15.120
Humbly, I ask that 
you feel my sadness

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.980
and return to your sensible self.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.060
I'm done with this.

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:22.810
My lord!

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:24.730
I'm sick of being Nobunaga.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:29.700
I'm going back to my own age.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.580
Master!

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:36.980
What is he on about this time?

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:38.050
After him!

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:40.210
There's no telling what 
 the master will do right now.

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.880
I bet,

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:48.800
to get back to my own age,

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:55.970
I have to fall from 
somewhere high.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.400
Out of the way!

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:11.590
My lord!

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:13.530
Damn.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:15.880
Guess I'm not getting 
home that easily.

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:20.290
Just what were you thinking?

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:21.390
Shut up, shut up!

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:22.850
Please listen to me!

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.560
I'm done with the lectures.

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:25.720
So heavy...

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:30.380
I'm sorry.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:35.090
You're super hot!

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:36.360
Who are you?

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:37.560
My lord!

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:43.440
How cruel must you be to ask 
your own lady who she is?

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.940
My wife?

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:49.870
<i>Nobunaga's wife, Kichou.</i>

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:56.610
I understand.

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:59.480
My lord dislikes me.

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:01.870
That is why you tried 
to stomp me to death.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.790
No, that was an honest accident.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:06.010
It was a political marriage, after all.

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:08.800
You have no real interest in me.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:09.840
Eh?

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:13.680
What could be more 
unhappy for a woman

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:16.390
than to be unloved by her husband?

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:19.280
I wonder if they 
don't get along well...

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:22.500
All right, I've got it!

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:24.730
Let's go on a date.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.280
A date?

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:36.200
My lord, where are you going?

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:56.640
Feels great...

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:05.560
I've never... been outside of the castle 
since I was married and sent to Owari.

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:06.970
Really?

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.230
The outside...

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:14.090
...feels good, indeed!

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:17.360
That's good.

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:23.290
My lord, you seem different today.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:25.190
Yeah?

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:30.590
Your pallor has returned... 
You look like a different person.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:34.480
My lord!

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:35.420
My lord!

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:36.600
My lord!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:37.340
My lord!

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.610
My lord!

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:40.260
My lord!

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:41.320
My lord!

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:42.590
My lord!

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:43.480
My lord!

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:45.040
My lord!

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:49.080
What is the master thinking?

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:51.350
I do not know.

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:57.810
I feel like I don't know the master any more!

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:23.820
Got one! A fish!

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:25.350
Impressive, my lord!

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:32.290
Oh, hey, Tsune-chan.

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:35.040
My lord,

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:37.700
I must...

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.310
...kill you.

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:43.920
Huh, why?

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:53.840
You have lost your mind!

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:57.960
That's rude!

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:01.980
Your bizarre behavior 
in recent days...

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:04.930
You cannot be of a right mind!

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:08.680
I regret having to kill you.

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:13.560
But we have no need 
for a crazy lord!

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:15.650
My lord!

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:24.380
You're such a pest.

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:30.250
Do you have any idea what 
you're trying to do?

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:35.550
If Nobunaga dies, it changes 
all that history I learned.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:36.740
<b>March 6th (Thu)
 Day duty: Kaida</b>

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:36.740
<b>Nobunaga Oda</b>

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.460
<b>Born in Nagoya Castle, Owari - Unification of Owari -
 Muromachi Shogunate Defeated - 
 Honnouji Incident</b>

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:43.090
So I can't let myself 
be killed here.

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:48.970
Nobunaga will become 
ruler of the land!

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:53.650
Nobunaga will become 
ruler of the land!

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:55.860
Ruler?

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.240
Yeah. Ruler.

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:05.110
Forgive me!

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:08.070
I have been a fool.

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:11.340
I had not thought that your sickliness 
and your silliness were all an act!

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:15.390
That, in fact, 
you had such ambitions!

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:17.230
Ambitions?

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:18.500
I am unworthy!

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:21.670
I will follow you until the end!

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.430
Ah... is that so?

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:25.380
Yes!

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:34.290
So you state that you, yourself, 
tried to take our lord's life.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:36.560
Forgive me!

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:39.440
However, I will mend my ways,

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:41.900
and follow my lord for life.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:47.200
My lord aspires to rule the land.

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:49.840
To rule?

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:52.790
He said that?

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:54.350
Yes!

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:02.890
I trust that you 
will mend your ways.

00:13:02.890 --> 00:13:03.910
But...

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:08.860
...it is troubling that 
Nobuyuki-sama was involved.

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:13.160
My lord, there is 
a cute flower here.

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.490
Yeah?

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:16.460
That's great.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:17.400
Yes.

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:25.030
I look forward to nothing more 
than going on dates with you.

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:30.830
Although dating is something you 
normally do in pairs, right, Tsune-chan?

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:34.250
I don't trust you two 
together alone!

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.940
I'm not going to attack her 
in a place like this.

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:39.000
What are you talking about?

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.810
I am saying there is no knowing

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:44.150
when one might come for your life!

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:47.290
It's pretty convincing 
when you say it.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:50.520
But I'm here to look for my bag.

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:51.580
Your what?

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:57.330
I dropped it around here somewhere 
when I slipped through time, so...

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:58.860
How strange.

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:03.870
Oh! My bag!

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:06.420
Thanks, Kichou!

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:07.120
Uh...

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.240
I'm so glad I found it.

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:15.760
Who is this?

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:18.110
I actually don't know...

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:23.120
Trapped in paper in such an indecent outfit...

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:26.620
This must be what 
they call sorcery!

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:28.040
No, it's a photo...

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:32.390
But why do you have such a thing?

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:35.420
Our marriage is in trouble.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:40.720
Want it?

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:41.880
I do not!

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:46.140
I'll give you this, Kichou.

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:48.320
<b>Insect Repellent</b>

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:48.320
I bet there're a lot 
of bugs around here.

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:54.430
<b>Expanded History of Japan</b>

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.330
There it is.

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:57.680
What is that?

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.890
My Japanese history textbook.

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:03.930
It describes the path 
to conquering the land...

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.650
I see!

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:08.260
You will use that text to 
study military strategy!

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:10.600
Don't talk to me right now.

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:15.090
I'm legitimately reading a textbook 
for the first time in my life.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:17.680
My...

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:22.850
Where are you going?

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:26.330
I probably won't get back to my 
own time anytime soon.

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:30.450
I figure I should probably live out 
Nobunaga's life for now.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:34.870
Better not change history, right?

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.240
<b>Expanded History of Japan</b>

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:40.770
No good. It just glosses 
over the big events.

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:45.650
Huh?

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:47.330
Where's Kichou?

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.650
Kichou!

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:53.180
Madam!

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:54.650
Kichou!

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:56.460
Madam!

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:57.560
Kichou!

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.430
Madam!

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:01.880
Kichou!

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:02.920
My lord!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:10.720
I can't believe they'd go after your wife...

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:12.150
Are you telling me 
she's been abducted?

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:14.250
Unfortunately...

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:17.740
My lord!

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:18.990
You musn't!

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:20.950
Why? I have to find her quick.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.730
It's too dangerous.

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:24.180
Return to the castle.

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:27.290
It would be better to ask the others to search for her.

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:30.020
We don't have time!

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:31.400
But... my lord!

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:35.180
We don't even know where 
to look for her!

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:35.180
It appears we have done well.

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:37.460
Indeed.

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:40.180
My brother is at fault

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:43.810
for bringing her out 
to a place like this

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:45.440
and allowing her to be abducted.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:47.860
The wife's father, Dousan Saito,

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:50.070
will not be without something 
to say about this.

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:56.330
Tsune-chan, I'll do as you say.

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:57.790
Let's go home for now.

00:16:57.790 --> 00:16:58.610
Yes!

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:01.940
Have they gone?

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:02.670
Yes.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:07.610
Then we're off, too.

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:08.480
Yes.

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:15.950
I knew it...

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:20.280
It was Nobuyuki-sama.

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:21.510
Knew what?

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:28.410
Nobuyuki-sama supported me 
when I attacked you.

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:30.420
Who's this Nobuyuki dude?

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.390
He is your younger brother,
 is he not?

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.100
Is he, now?

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:38.410
My lord?!

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:43.450
You there, stop!

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:46.900
Brother...

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:05.310
Stop!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:06.180
Split up!

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:06.960
Yes!

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:09.610
Tsune-chan!

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:10.400
Yeah!

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:22.490
Stop, Nobuyuki!

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.120
I said...

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:34.000
<i>...STOP!</i>

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:38.840
Where's Kichou?

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:40.530
I do not know.

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:42.590
Of course you know!

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:44.100
Where did you take Kichou?

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:46.040
I said I do not know.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.430
My lord!

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:50.230
I know where Madam is.

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:53.190
The other man talked!

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:58.430
Nobuyuki, you're playing dirty.

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:00.880
If it's me you want, 
just come at me straight.

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:15.380
Madam should be in that shed, 
along with some people hired by Nobuyuki.

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.710
My lord, I had better go first...

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:20.820
You're all surrounded!

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:24.060
Come out peacefully!

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.540
What a waste of time.

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:32.060
My lord!

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:39.190
My lord!

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:40.650
Kichou!

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:45.090
My lord, I was so afraid.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.350
I'm sorry.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:53.490
Why are those men 
shuddering in the corner?

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:58.450
I told them this mist 
would kill them if it touched them,

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:00.670
and they stopped 
coming towards me.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:02.860
Literally, bug repellant!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:06.030
What are you...

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:09.100
Will I die? Will I die?!

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:10.620
You're probably fine.

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:11.590
Probably?!

00:20:11.590 --> 00:20:13.590
Probably? My lord!

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:14.920
You're probably fine.

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:16.330
My lord!

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:20.410
<i>With his rebellious intentions towards 
his older brother, Nobunaga, revealed,</i>

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:24.830
<i>Nobuyuki was locked in a temple.</i>

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:27.950
<i>And so ended this fight between 
the two siblings... for now.</i>

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:33.750
I'd go hide in a temple 
if I were Nobuyuki-sama, too.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:36.670
Truly, truly.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:40.740
It's frightening how much of a fool 
Nobunaga-sama has become.

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:42.670
No kidding.

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:44.800
What is this?

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:47.180
Sounds like a fun chat.

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:51.890
Nobunaga-sama cross-dressed and 
tackled Nobuyuki-sama, I hear.

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:53.060
Whoa!

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:55.740
He's truly a fool.

00:20:56.110 --> 00:21:00.230
He is a fool indeed.

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:18.330
Wait.

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:20.800
Did Nobunaga end up 
conquering the land?
